    "description": "On this tour, you’ll have the chance to see views of berlin from 500 feet up as you ride on the Berlin WELT-Ballon, one of the world’s biggest helium balloons. \r\n\r\nAfter boarding the balloon, you’ll slowly ascend to a height of 500 feet, tethered to the ground at all times by a strong steel rope. As you hover above the ground in a 15-minute ride, you’ll be able to see aerial views of the city and many of its most iconic landmarks, including Checkpoint Charlie, Sony Centre and the Brandenburg Gate.",
