    "additionalInfo": "Please note, flights are weather-dependent and may be cancelled during adverse weather conditions.\r\n\r\nReduced ticket prices are available for:\r\n-\tStudents (with a valid student ID)\r\n-\tDisabled people (and their carer) with a valid B pass.\r\n\r\nPlease contact the tour provider in advance of your visit if you use a wheelchair that exceeds standard dimensions or features additional attachments.\r\n\r\nChildren aged 0–2 years may ride for free.\r\n\r\nThe Berlin WELT-Ballon opening times are as follows:\r\n\r\nMay–September: 10:00–18:00\r\nOctober–April: 10:00–16:00.\r\n\r\nBalloon rides depart every 15 minutes during opening hours.\r\n\r\nPlease bring your ticket with you to the attraction.\r\n\r\nBe aware that operators may cancel for unforeseen reasons.\r\n\r\nYou need to be 18 years or older to book or be accompanied by an adult. ",
